      {
        "_id": "6ab3b9590d62e8f9d43055cd",
        "authorName": "Krystian Reyes",
        "roleOrLocation": "Local Guide · Melbourne VIC",
        "rating": 5,
        "reviewText": "Looking into and doing all the research when it comes to choosing and organising solar panels and batteries can be daunting, and it definitely was for me. John from Aussie Smart Energy was amazing, so helpful and accommodating. He was the first person I spoke to. He helped me assess our household energy usage and presented options best suited for our household. After my initial conversation, went out and did more research and more quotes and came back to John to 1) help me understand more of what I was seeking, and 2) to see what he could do about other offers that were presented to me. In the end he not only worked a better value package, but also presented better products for my solar and battery package (we went with a 6.6kw solar panel set up with a 30kw battery system and Wifi monitored inverter). John was amazing through the whole process including organising all the government rebate paperwork, financing for the system, and organising delivery and installation of the solar panel and battery system. I would definitely recommend John's customer service to anyone who is thinking about going down the solar power path!",
        "authorImage": "",
        "reviewDate": "6 months ago",
        "reviewLink": "https://maps.app.goo.gl/LhbwSNgZT1Sy6i4j9",
