      {
        "_id": "6ab3b9590d62e8f9d43055d3",
        "authorName": "Adelio Antonio",
        "roleOrLocation": "Verified Customer",
        "rating": 5,
        "reviewText": "Highly Recommend Aussie Smart Energy! I recently had a solar battery installed by the team at Aussie Smart Energy, and the experience was excellent. From the start, they were professional, took the time to understand my specific needs, and provided a solution perfectly tailored to our home's requirements. The installation was quick, tidy, and high-quality. What impressed me most was the after-care; they guided me through the app setup and clearly explained how to operate and monitor the unit. They ensured all my concerns were addressed promptly and thoroughly. If you're looking for a reliable solar solution, I highly recommend their services.",
        "authorImage": "",
        "reviewDate": "5 months ago",
