        "_id": "6ab3b9590d62e8f9d43055d0",
        "authorName": "Steve King",
        "roleOrLocation": "Local Guide · Victoria",
        "rating": 5,
        "reviewText": "I have just had a 21 kw battery system installed by Aussie Smart Energy. John was recommended by the people who installed our EV Charger and was very helpful from start to finish. The battery was installed over half a day at my convenience and showed a massive reduction (monitoring via PowerPal) in grid energy supply from the moment it was linked up. Price and service were within my budget, and I am so happy with my purchase and the service provided by John and the team.",
